    <description>RT: Opty w/ Products.  Code Name GNR and Public Cloud with Intel® Xeon® 6.  &apos;25 2H Fiscal.  OPEN Opportunities.  DEAL, Sell-To and Through.  Exclude Vertical Market CSP &amp; ComSP</description>
